      "sourceText": "| 链路阶段 | `vx、vy` 参考的方向 | `wz` 的含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 导航控制器计算，再经平滑器得到 `cmd_vel_nav2_result` | 虚拟云台系 `gimbal_yaw_fake` 的 x、y 轴 | 导航提出的旋转分量；恢复行为也可向该话题提供指令 |\n| 本节点发布 `cmd_vel` | 实际云台 yaw 层 `gimbal_yaw` 的 x、y 轴 | 输入导航角速度 + 附加自旋角速度 |\n| `serial_comm` 接收并发送给MCU | 原样传递上述云台系分量，没有再转成底盘系 | 原样传递已相加的总量，约定由底盘执行 |\n| MCU驱动底盘 | 若控制算法需要底盘系速度，须按机械相对 yaw 换算 | 应执行这条底盘目标角速度，不再重复叠加同一自旋量；实际实现待核对 |",
      "translatedText": "| Link stage | `vx、vy` Reference direction | `wz` meaning of |\n|---|---|---|\n|  computed by the navigation controller, then smoothed to obtain `cmd_vel_nav2_result` |  virtual gimbal frame `gimbal_yaw_fake` x and y axes of |  rotation component proposed by navigation; the recovery behavior may also provide commands to this topic |\n|  This node publishes `cmd_vel` |  actual gimbal yaw layer `gimbal_yaw` x and y axes of |  input navigation angular velocity \\+ additional spin angular velocity |\n| `serial_comm` receives and sends to the MCU |  pass through the above gimbal\\-frame components as\\-is, without converting again to the chassis frame |  pass through the summed total as\\-is, with the chassis agreed to execute it |\n|  MCU drives the chassis |  if the control algorithm requires chassis\\-frame velocity, it must be converted according to the mechanical relative yaw |  should execute this chassis target angular velocity without re\\-adding the same spin component; the actual implementation is to be verified |",
